Recommends: systemd
Description: Manage multiple Spotify Soloist devices with automatic updates
 soloistd supervises one or more Spotify Soloist instances in a single systemd
 user service. Each can use a different device name and PipeWire destination.
 It keeps the Soloist API key outside the unit and checks for official updates.
 .
 When a new official build appears, soloistd downloads and validates it,
 atomically replaces its user-owned copy of the Soloist executable, and
 restarts all running instances gracefully. The documented "build expired"
 exit status is retained as an independent recovery path.
